      118.56,
      357.96,
      219.0,
      379.56
    ],
    "text": "Notice Under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      391.96,
      286.67,
      468.8
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      470.23,
      286.66,
      617.36
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired : The following block of land which is located within the below mentioned boundaries, and this block of land constitute 0.0078 Hectares from a distinct portion of Moraketiyawaththa depicted as lot number 887 of main plan numbered as F.V.P. 299, Supplement No. 7, Sheet No. 7, drawn after having being surveyed by Survey General, and situated in Kanda Pahala Korale minor Division, Gurulupota Grama Niladhari Division, Gurulupota village which comes under the purview of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Minipe, Kandy District in Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.63,
      539.43,
      379.76
    ],
    "text": "To North : Lot Numbers 872 and 95; To East and South : Lot Number 95; To west : Lot Numbers 95 and 872.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      380.96,
      539.41,
      516.32
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land on which a Servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Minipe Divisional Secretariat on 30th August, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 03rd of July, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the Acquisition of the said land/Servitude* the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
